# VS Code's packager (gulp vscode-win32-x64-min) lists this extension through this file. Its code is bundled by esbuild
# into out/; the agent adapters in node_modules are NOT listed here: `npm run installer` installs just the production
# dependencies of this extension into the packaged app itself.
node_modules/**
src/**
**/*.map
**/*.ts
tsconfig*.json
esbuild.mjs
package-lock.json
.vscodeignore
